# Copy to .env.local and fill in. EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the app bundle,
# so they are public: only use keys meant for client apps.

# REST Countries v5 (country data for Explore). Free key: https://restcountries.com/sign-up
# Without it, country sections and search show "not available in this version".
EXPO_PUBLIC_RESTCOUNTRIES_API_KEY=
